===Etymology===
1867,<ref>{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary}}</ref> following earlier {{m|en|nerve-racking}} (1812).

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|head=[[nerve]]-[[wracking]]}}

# {{label|en|proscribed}} Intensely [[distress]]ing or [[irritate|irritating]] to the [[nerves]].

====Usage notes====
Etymologically incorrect, but in common use; strict usage prefers original {{m|en|nerve-racking}}. See [[rack#Usage notes|usage notes for ''rack'']] for details.

